es for SKILL.md, capabilities.json and reconstruct.py respectively, and 139 Python lines; it also warned that __pycache__ was a directory. SKILL.md subsequently received a short validation caveat."],\n  "selection_probe": "Created /app/selection_probe.blend using /app/validation_probe.py: editable selection-inspired table, leg, chair seat and hinged leaf, plus camera and floor. It is a limited synthetic probe, not a reconstruction, a render comparison or selection GT. The hinge point alignment was tested for one pose only; table-leg AABB overlap is a candidate only.",\n  "failed_or_rejected_candidates": ["No Blender test exception was observed. The initial wc command warned about the generated cache directory; this was not a method test failure.", "As documented in /app/research_evidence.json, reject transplanting historical scene-specific door transforms as a general repair and reject treating equal heights, node count or AABB overlap as proof of contact or material improvement."],\n  "changes": ["Added explicit limits on synthetic validation to /app/library/SKILL.md; no executable unit was modified.", "Preserved probe script, editable blend and Blender logs outside the student library."],\n  "remaining_unvalidated_methods": ["Image-based reconstruction accuracy and improvement on independent scenes", "Material visual output, rendered pattern direction and illumination separation", "Full-frame camera and layout optimization", "Door swing clearance, complete opening geometry and assembly-wide articulation", "Mesh-level intersection, true physical contact, connectivity and load-bearing", "Support and coordinate behavior across arbitrary transforms and meshes"],\n  "applicability_and_side_effects": ["point_camera changes camera transform and possibly lens; hinge_pose changes parenting and transform. Its authored local leaf geometry and unparented hinge assumptions matter; a point-distance report does not verify a full assembly.", "mapped_stone creates a material datablock and does not bind it automatically. Probe explicitly bound it; a shared coordinate object controls its reference frame. No external image resources were used by this material.", "support_probe samples lowest vertices and only supplied meshes; no hit is unknown, not absent support. Near-zero is not proof of contact. AABB overlap is only broad-phase triage."],\n  "final_library_files": ["/app/library/SKILL.md", "/app/library/capabilities.json", "/app/library/reconstruct.py"]\n}\n'}}], 'model': 'gpt-6.1-terra', 'parent_tool_use_id': None, 'error': None, 'usage': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cache_creation_input_tokens': 0, 'cache_read_input_tokens': 0}, 'message_id': 'msg_587870c8-71a1-43cb-b96b-9c4e2eee7b85', 'stop_reason': None, 'session_id': 'c8700bce-9731-4cad-8da4-872db8622593', 'uuid': '38194bc2-421b-4c63-9dc0-e70e2dfd9411', 'user_message_uuid': None, 'user_message_uuids': None}
